      "title": "CyberXero: An AI-Augmented Initial Access Broker Targeting Ukrainian Critical Infrastructure",
      "summary": "CyberXero is a Russian-speaking, financially motivated Initial Access Broker that wraps its commodity offensive tooling in an AI orchestration layer. It runs a global, automated campaign against WordPress and e-commerce platforms alongside a curated, manual campaign against Ukrainian energy and critical infrastructure. More than 628,000 Ukrainian individuals have confirmed data in the actor's possession, including residents of Kharkiv, a city on an active war front. The operation was exposed by a single configuration error: an open directory serving the actor's live working directory, including AI session logs and victim data. The actor used context engineering and session resets to work around model refusals, so defenders should treat AI agent session logs as sensitive material.",
